{"name":"拟物化","description":"拟物化是一种模仿现实物体外观和操作线索的界面设计风格 · 它会借用皮革、金属、纸张、旋钮和实体按钮等熟悉线索帮助用户理解操作。现在多用于复古主题、乐器类应用和局部装饰，材质细节不能压过文字和功能。","quote":"早期 iPhone 那种，按钮像真按钮、笔记本像真本子。","agentPrompt":"","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-style-skeuomorphism\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>拟物化<span>Skeuomorphism</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">早期 iPhone 那种，按钮像真按钮、笔记本像真本子。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">拟物化是一种模仿现实物体外观和操作线索的界面设计风格</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>它会借用皮革、金属、纸张、旋钮和实体按钮等熟悉线索帮助用户理解操作。现在多用于复古主题、乐器类应用和局部装饰，材质细节不能压过文字和功能。</span></div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"dh-demo style-detail-demo\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"风格示例，可横向滚动\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"style-detail-canvas\"><div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-demo style-skeuomorphism-console\">\n    <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-console-top\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-brand\">MELLOWTAPE <i>STUDIO RECORDER</i></span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-console-status\"><b></b> INPUT LIVE</span></div>\n    <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-console-main\">\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-reels\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-reel\"><i></i></span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-tape\"></span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-reel right\"><i></i></span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-ledger\"><small>TAKE 04 · UNTITLED ROOM</small><strong>00:02:18</strong><span><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-meters\"><b>L</b><i><em></em></i><b>R</b><i><em></em></i></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-console-controls\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-metal-knob\"></span><small>INPUT</small><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-deck-key\">◀◀</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-record-key\">●<i>REC</i></span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-deck-key\">▶</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-metal-knob small\"></span><small>OUTPUT</small></div>\n  </div></div></div></section><section class=\"principles-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">设计原则 · Principles</div><div class=\"usage-box use principles-box\"><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选择用户熟悉的现实物体，让材质和形状帮助理解功能</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用高光和投影表达凸起、凹下和可以按动的状态</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">先保证操作含义清楚，再增加皮革、金属或纸张等细节</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">纹理只用于不影响阅读的区域，并控制图片体积</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">在现代产品中优先局部使用，避免材质覆盖所有内容</div></li></ul></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">面向初次使用设备的人，用现实线索帮助理解</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">教长辈用平板</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\">点这里发语音</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">复古、手账和乐器应用，材质本身是主题</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch leather\" style=\"width:64px\">日记本</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">复古手账应用，材质支持主题表达</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">相机和合成器等拟真控制面板</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch wood\">木</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch metal\">弦</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);max-width:120px\">相机、录音、合成器的拟真面板</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">现代界面里的少量局部材质装饰</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-strip\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">现代浅色界面里，局部一条皮革当点缀</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把正文直接放在干扰阅读的复杂纹理上</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch linen\" style=\"width:150px;height:44px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7a6a4a\">正文落在纹理上</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">过度依赖大图材质，造成加载和缩放问题</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">一个界面使用多张材质图</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">资源需评估</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">数据密集工具让装饰降低扫描效率</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch leather\" style=\"width:78px\">报表中心</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">材质与任务不匹配</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">效率工具应优先保证数据与操作清楚</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">整站复制旧系统外观，却没有明确复古目的</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\">登录</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch metal\" style=\"width:40px\"></span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch wood\" style=\"width:40px\"></span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">发展历程 · History</div><div class=\"history-rail\"><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2007.01</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>iPhone 发布，拟物界面受关注</b><p>滑动解锁、翻页日历等界面把现实动作和材质带入触屏产品，帮助用户理解交互方式。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2010—2012</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>质感表现广泛出现</b><p>iOS 5/6 中的黄纸备忘录、木质报刊亭和绿毡 Game Center，呈现了不同的现实材质隐喻。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2013.09</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>iOS 7 扁平化转向</b><p>iOS 7 以更简化的界面取代此前大量皮革与亚麻纹理；这一变化加速了业内对扁平化的讨论。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2020s</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>装饰性材质再被探索</b><p>新拟态、玻璃和空间材质等方向再次引起讨论；拟物元素更多作为局部表现方式出现。</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-anat\">\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-anat-notes\">\n        <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-bar\" data-ap=\"leather\">备忘录</span>\n        <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-paper style-skeuomorphism-anat-paper\" data-ap=\"paper\">横线黄纸 + 红边距线</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-mini-btn\" data-ap=\"gloss\">玻璃高光按钮</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-mini-swatch linen\" data-ap=\"texture\" style=\"width:76px\">亚麻布纹</span>\n      <span class=\"ap style-skeuomorphism-shadowchip\" data-ap=\"shadow\">真实投影</span>\n    </div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"leather\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">皮革缝线标题栏</span><span class=\"pe\">Stitched Leather</span></button><span class=\"pd\">棕色渐变打底，上下两条虚线当缝线，文字用内阴影压出凹刻感</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"paper\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">黄纸纹理</span><span class=\"pe\">Yellow Legal Pad</span></button><span class=\"pd\"> repeating 渐变画横线，左侧一条红色边距线，配手写感字体</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"gloss\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">玻璃高光</span><span class=\"pe\">Glossy Highlight</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可用浅色渐变和内高光提示光滑材质；只在需要时使用，避免影响文字</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"texture\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">亚麻布纹底</span><span class=\"pe\">Linen Texture</span></button><span class=\"pd\">两组交叉的细密 repeating 渐变，大面积空白处的经典打底</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"shadow\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">真实投影</span><span class=\"pe\">Realistic Shadow</span></button><span class=\"pd\">大而柔、带环境色的投影，让元素像真的浮在桌面上</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"prompt-section prompt-section-dialogue\"><div class=\"section-title\">AI 提示词 · Prompt</div><div class=\"prompt-box prompt-box-dialogue\"><blockquote><p>做一个复古旅行日志应用，让相册、地图和收藏内容具有清楚的识别线索。用少量有意义的材料和触感提示帮助理解功能，按钮与文字仍要清楚；不要把纹理和高光铺满整个界面。</p></blockquote><button type=\"button\" class=\"prompt-copy\" aria-label=\"复制\" title=\"复制\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">拟物化磁带录音台</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"拟物化磁带录音台\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene\">\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-head\"><span>MELLOWTAPE</span><b>SESSION / VOCAL 04</b><i>● RECORDING</i></div>\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-board\">\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-track\"><b>VOICE</b><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-wave\"></span><em>-8 dB</em></div>\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-track\"><b>GUITAR</b><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-wave alt\"></span><em>-14 dB</em></div>\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-fader\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-scene-footer\"><span>00:02:18 / 03:40</span><b>● <i>RECORD</i></b><span>48 kHz · STEREO</span></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">iOS 6 计算器</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"iOS 6 计算器\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"width:264px;border-radius:20px;border:3px solid #26262a;background:#1c1c1e;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">\n        <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(#d7dce4,#b9c0cb);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.15);text-align:right;padding:8px 14px;font-size:26px;font-weight:300;color:#2b2f36;margin-bottom:12px\">1,024</div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px\">\n          <span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">C</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">±</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">%</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">÷</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">7</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">8</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">9</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">×</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">4</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">5</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">6</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">−</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">1</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">2</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">3</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-key orange\" style=\"width:auto;height:30px\">+</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">iOS 6 设置开关页</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"iOS 6 设置开关页\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)\">\n        <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(#7f8590,#5b626d);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding:8px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25)\">设置</div>\n        <div style=\"background:#e8e8ec;padding:12px\">\n          <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #b8bcc4;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.12)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dbe0\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">无线局域网</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#2a7de1;text-shadow:0 1px 0 #fff\">Home-WiFi &gt;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dbe0\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">通知</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch sm\"><i class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-fill\"></i><b class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-knob\"></b></span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px 12px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1d2129\">定位服务</span><span class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch sm\"><i class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-fill\"></i><b class=\"style-skeuomorphism-switch-knob\"></b></span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">iOS 报刊亭书架</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"iOS 报刊亭书架\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px;border-radius:12px\" class=\"style-skeuomorphism-linen\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\">\n        <div class=\"style-skeuomorphism-bar\">报刊亭</div>\n        <div style=\"background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#7a5230 0 8px,#6a4527 8px 16px);padding:18px 20px 0\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-forest.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/slide-city.png\" style=\"width:100px;height:142px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"height:14px;margin-top:-2px;background:linear-gradient(#8a5f3a,#5e3d20);box-shadow:0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2);border-radius:2px\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/skeuomorphism/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">拟物化</span><span class=\"reference-source\">NN/g ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/style-skeuomorphism","markdown":"# 拟物化Skeuomorphism\n\n你可能会说\n早期 iPhone 那种，按钮像真按钮、笔记本像真本子。\n\n**拟物化是一种模仿现实物体外观和操作线索的界面设计风格**·它会借用皮革、金属、纸张、旋钮和实体按钮等熟悉线索帮助用户理解操作。现在多用于复古主题、乐器类应用和局部装饰，材质细节不能压过文字和功能。\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n设计原则 · Principles\n\n- 选择用户熟悉的现实物体，让材质和形状帮助理解功能\n- 用高光和投影表达凸起、凹下和可以按动的状态\n- 先保证操作含义清楚，再增加皮革、金属或纸张等细节\n- 纹理只用于不影响阅读的区域，并控制图片体积\n- 在现代产品中优先局部使用，避免材质覆盖所有内容\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- 面向初次使用设备的人，用现实线索帮助理解\n\n教长辈用平板点这里发语音\n- 复古、手账和乐器应用，材质本身是主题\n\n日记本复古手账应用，材质支持主题表达\n- 相机和合成器等拟真控制面板\n\n木弦相机、录音、合成器的拟真面板\n- 现代界面里的少量局部材质装饰\n\n现代浅色界面里，局部一条皮革当点缀\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 把正文直接放在干扰阅读的复杂纹理上\n\n正文落在纹理上\n- 过度依赖大图材质，造成加载和缩放问题\n\n一个界面使用多张材质图资源需评估\n- 数据密集工具让装饰降低扫描效率\n\n报表中心材质与任务不匹配\n效率工具应优先保证数据与操作清楚\n- 整站复制旧系统外观，却没有明确复古目的\n\n登录\n\n发展历程 · History\n\n2007.01\n**iPhone 发布，拟物界面受关注**\n滑动解锁、翻页日历等界面把现实动作和材质带入触屏产品，帮助用户理解交互方式。\n\n2010—2012\n**质感表现广泛出现**\niOS 5/6 中的黄纸备忘录、木质报刊亭和绿毡 Game Center，呈现了不同的现实材质隐喻。\n\n2013.09\n**iOS 7 扁平化转向**\niOS 7 以更简化的界面取代此前大量皮革与亚麻纹理；这一变化加速了业内对扁平化的讨论。\n\n2020s\n**装饰性材质再被探索**\n新拟态、玻璃和空间材质等方向再次引起讨论；拟物元素更多作为局部表现方式出现。\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n备忘录\n        横线黄纸 + 红边距线\n\n      玻璃高光按钮\n      亚麻布纹\n      真实投影\n\n1皮革缝线标题栏Stitched Leather棕色渐变打底，上下两条虚线当缝线，文字用内阴影压出凹刻感\n\n2黄纸纹理Yellow Legal Pad repeating 渐变画横线，左侧一条红色边距线，配手写感字体\n\n3玻璃高光Glossy Highlight可用浅色渐变和内高光提示光滑材质；只在需要时使用，避免影响文字\n\n4亚麻布纹底Linen Texture两组交叉的细密 repeating 渐变，大面积空白处的经典打底\n\n5真实投影Realistic Shadow大而柔、带环境色的投影，让元素像真的浮在桌面上\n\nAI 提示词 · Prompt\n\n> 做一个复古旅行日志应用，让相册、地图和收藏内容具有清楚的识别线索。用少量有意义的材料和触感提示帮助理解功能，按钮与文字仍要清楚；不要把纹理和高光铺满整个界面。\n\n典型使用场景\n\n拟物化磁带录音台\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\nMELLOWTAPE**SESSION / VOCAL 04**● RECORDING\n\n      \n**VOICE**-8 dB\n\n        \n**GUITAR**-14 dB\n\n      \n00:02:18 / 03:40**● RECORD**48 kHz · STEREO\n\niOS 6 计算器\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n1,024\n\n        \nC±%÷789×456−123+\n\niOS 6 设置开关页\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n设置\n\n        \n无线局域网Home-WiFi >\n\n            \n通知****\n\n            \n定位服务****\n\niOS 报刊亭书架\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n报刊亭\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[拟物化NN/g ↗](https://www.nngroup.com/articles/skeuomorphism/)"}